<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission economic forecast for France.</title>
<headline>EU Commission economic forecast for France.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for France -</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		1.1	   2.1</p>
<p> Investment		     -0.4	   3.5</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.9	   1.4</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	   12.3	  12.4</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 4.0	   3.0</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 56.4	  58.1</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
